	<string>IzzyDrive Client uses your location to find nearby mechanics and to share your location with the mechanic assisting you.</string>
	<key>NSMicrophoneUsageDescription</key>
	<string>IzzyDrive Client uses the microphone so you can record and send voice messages to the mechanic.</string>
